{
  "summary": "Switches `contrib/guix/guix-build` from exporting the `GUIX_PACKAGE_PATH` environment variable to passing `--load-path` directly to `guix shell`. This ensures local modules are scoped only to the pinned Guix invocation.",
  "problem": "Exporting `GUIX_PACKAGE_PATH` globally during the Guix build leaks local package modules outside the pinned Guix execution, causing Guix build failures on master (#36530).",
  "evidence": [
    "Fixes #36530, titled 'Guix build failure on master (f13ae519de94394314cd63a27924b0998ac65d45)'",
    "Code comment in diff explains the rationale: 'passed to `guix shell` via --load-path, rather than exported via GUIX_PACKAGE_PATH, so they are only seen by the pinned Guix.'"
